[h1] Audio

[h2] Basic usage

[p-]
Embed an audio player for a .sfx file hosted on podnet.
The player lets visitors play, pause, stop and rewind the track
without leaving the page. The pattern where it should start to play can be selected with 
the pattern property. It defaults to 0.
[-p]

[code-]
[audio url=podnet://YOUR_ID/music.sfx pattern=1]
[-code]

[audio url=podnet://48932/test.sfx]

[h2] align

[p] Default is center. Options: left, center, right.

[code-]
[audio url=podnet://YOUR_ID/music.sfx align=left]
[audio url=podnet://YOUR_ID/music.sfx align=center]
[audio url=podnet://YOUR_ID/music.sfx align=right]
[-code]

[audio url=podnet://48932/test.sfx align=left]
[audio url=podnet://48932/test.sfx align=center]
[audio url=podnet://48932/test.sfx align=right]

[h2] Notes

[p-]
Only one track plays at a time. Pressing play on one player
automatically stops any other audio that is currently playing.
[-p]

[p-]
The .sfx file format is Picotron's native audio format.
You can export one from the sound editor and upload it
to your podnet storage with the publish tool.
[-p]

